WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
Many Jews see wealth as a
gift from God, held in trust.

2
00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:07.650
And a gift held in trust comes with rules.

3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:12.180
Even a person who lives on gifts to
the poor is expected to give some.

4
00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:17.370
So if wealth is no sin, why does Judaism
set so many limits on what you do with

5
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:18.300
it?

6
00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:22.660
In this mission, you'll read a prophet
who says a true fast means freeing the

7
00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:25.000
oppressed and feeding the hungry.

8
00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.620
Then you'll climb a
famous ladder of giving,

9
00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.680
and see how Jews work for justice today.

10
00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:36.130
Your mission: find out why Judaism sets
so many limits on what you do with wealth.
